#: ../../source/docs/common-radio-control-calibration.rst:41
#: 16fe5cf216d1479d8b7301fc941346da 330a3439b37b426eba008ea84018144a
#: 4cf32b6067694245bfc404c6ac34a135 5c71d8c1076c4958b54f6191c9d45566
